@startuml Refund_A_Failed_Payment_Sequence
participant "Payment Processing" as Payment
participant "Biller Integration / Biller" as Biller
participant Wallet
participant Ledger
participant "Audit Log" as Audit
participant Notifications as Notify
actor Customer

Payment -> Biller: Query/receive failed payment result
Biller --> Payment: Confirm failure
Payment -> Wallet: Release held amount
Wallet -> Ledger: Record fund release
Ledger --> Wallet: Release recorded
Payment -> Audit: Record failure and refund/release event
Payment -> Notify: Send failure notification
Notify --> Customer: Payment failed; funds released
@enduml
